## Actions

| Action | What it does |
|---|---|
| Greet | Logs a greeting and shows it on the key |
| Switch | A toggle with On / Off states |
| Press Counter | Live label counting Greet presses |

## Build

```bash
knobdeck-plugin dev            # debug build -> dist/{{id}}/, then "Load Unpacked" in KnobDeck
knobdeck-plugin dev --watch    # rebuild on change; KnobDeck restarts the plugin
knobdeck-plugin drive          # run it over the protocol without KnobDeck (smoke test)
knobdeck-plugin build          # release build
knobdeck-plugin package        # dist/{{id}}.knobdeck
```
